    "detailed_description": "Bounty hunter &quot;Momokka&quot; challenges the sea labyrinth &quot;Dungeon Beach&quot;.<br />\r\nAim to completely conquer the 30-story random dungeon while making full use of actions and items!<br />\r\nPlatform action. It takes about an hour to play one time, but you can interrupt the play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbExplore the labyrinth while looking at the map!<br />\r\nLet's explore while looking at the map so you don't get lost.<br />\r\nLet's look for the goal gate somewhere while checking the connection of the roads.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Defeat enemies and level up!<br />\r\nUse &quot;Screw Attack&quot;, &quot;Sliding&quot;, and &quot;Shot&quot; to defeat the enemies infesting the dungeon.<br />\r\nBy defeating many enemies, you can level up and strengthen Momoka's abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbLet's make full use of items!<br />\r\nTreasure chests found in dungeons contain useful items.<br />\r\nUse items wisely to explore dungeons efficiently.",
